// HeldStateTests (LLP 1121 stage 8 E2): a card that presses, its `:active`
// the press paint, with a child that is a flat leaf on iOS (a box with only a
// fill and its size: no props, no handlers), and the count of its presses.
keyframes rangeIn
  from opacity=0 translate="0px 8px"

component App
  state n = 0
  state expanded = false
  state entering = false
  action go
    n = n + 1
  action revealEntering
    entering = true
    expanded = true
  action reveal
    expanded = not expanded
  state changeReady = false
  state changeWidth = 80
  state changeSeen = -1
  state changeAt = -1
  state changeFocused = false
  action changeStart
    changeReady = true
  action changeExpand
    changeWidth = 160
  action changeRead
    changeSeen = frame("change-target").width
    changeAt = performanceNow()
    focus("change-target")
  action changeFocus
    changeFocused = true
  task changeMeasure when changeReady key=changeWidth
    change(changeRead)
  task changeLater when changeReady
    after(5, changeExpand)
  view
    main testId="root" width=400 height=400 background-color="#ffffff"
      box testId="card" press=go width=200 height=100 background-color="#ffffff"
        :active
          background-color = "#0000ff"
        box width=20 height=20 background-color="#00ff00"
      text `n ${n}` testId="count"
      box testId="hover-scale" width=100 height=100 background-color="#ff0000" transition="scale 150ms linear"
        :hover
          scale=1.2
      button testId="reveal-range" press=reveal
        text "Reveal range"
      button "Reveal entering" testId="reveal-entering-range" press=revealEntering position="absolute" left=300 top=260 width=80 height=30
      column testId="range-section" width=240 overflow="hidden" -exact-layout-transition="220ms linear"
        if expanded
          column testId="inserted-range" padding="12px 0px" animation=(entering ? "rangeIn 160ms linear both" : "none")
            text "Volume" color="#ff0000"
            input testId="inserted-slider" type="range" value=0.3 min=0 max=1 step=0.01 width="100%" margin-top=8
        column testId="range-following" height=90 background-color="#0000ff" z-index=1 -exact-layout-transition="220ms linear"
      button "Change" press=changeStart testId="change-start" position="absolute" left=300 top=300 width=80 height=30
      if changeReady
        input id="change-target" testId="change-target" focus=changeFocus position="absolute" left=220 top=200 width=changeWidth box-sizing="border-box"
        box width=changeWidth height=1 position="absolute" top=360 -exact-layout-transition="100ms linear"
